              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Meshwesh. hand weapon and javelins. Light Infantry; subject to Warband (rule 2 does not apply). Meshwesh (a term we are using for elite infantry) may have throwing spears (+2 points) and shields (+1 points) Meshwesh units may not be larger than the largest warrior unit. Warriors hand weapon and javelins. Light Infantry. Warband (rule 2 does not apply). There must be two units of warriors for each unit of Meshwesh. One unit of Warriors in every three may exchange javelins for short bow (free). Skirmishers. hand weapon and javelins. Skirmishers.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="26c8-6f29-fab5-8b3f" name="Warband" hidden="false" targetId="e230-5072-4109-a786" type="rule"/>
